cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  参考に何か作ったときは、どこかに書いてもらえるとうれしいです。
  If you build something based on this, a credit like this would be appreciated:
  "Based on symysak/arib — https://github.com/symysak/arib".
title: arib
abstract: >-
  ARIB 標準規格のデジタル無線（STD-T86 / STD-T115 / STD-T79 / STD-T61）の受信側の実装。
  規格書の記述を実際の電波で確かめるために作った。
  A receiver-side implementation of ARIB digital radio standards (STD-T86 / STD-T115 / STD-T79 / STD-T61),
  written to check the specifications against over-the-air signals.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: symysak
repository-code: "https://github.com/symysak/arib"
url: "https://github.com/symysak/arib"
keywords:
  - ARIB STD-T86
  - ARIB STD-T115
  - ARIB STD-T79
  - ARIB STD-T61
  - software-defined radio
  - digital demodulation
  - protocol analysis
  - reference implementation
